fluents:	on(D,L) requires disk(D), location(L).
		clear(L) requires location(L).

actions:	move(D,L,L1) requires disk(D), location(L), location(L1).

always:		executable move(D,L,L1) if on(D,L), clear(L1), clear(D).
                nonexecutable move(D,L,L).
                nonexecutable move(d2,L,d1).

                caused on(D,L1) after move(D,L,L1).
                caused -on(D,L) after move(D,L,L1).
